      "translations": {
        "en": "It was said to Abu Abdillah (peace be upon him): 'We enter upon a brother of ours in a house of orphans, and with them is a servant for them. So we sit on their mat, and we drink from their water, and their servant serves us, and perhaps we eat the food there from our companion, and it includes some of their food. So what do you think regarding that?' He (peace be upon him) said: 'If in your entering upon them there is benefit for them, then there is no problem, and if there is harm in it, then [there is] no [benefit].'"
      }
